    "steps": [
      "Toss the tomatoes and torn Thai basil with the salt and black pepper in a medium bowl. Let them rest for 10 minutes.",
      "Whisk the Greek yogurt with the curry powder, lime juice and olive oil in a small bowl. Add salt and black pepper to your liking, then chill.",
      "Combine the champagne vinegar, sugar, coriander seeds, a cup of water and a little salt in a saucepan. Boil, then lower the heat and simmer 5–8 minutes.",
